WEBVTT

NOTE English translation of the client's words in Hindi.

00:00.000 --> 00:01.740
Hi, thank you so much, Webincline.

00:01.960 --> 00:04.700
I've really enjoyed being associated with you.

00:04.700 --> 00:07.640
First of all, congratulations
on completing your 11th year.

00:08.820 --> 00:11.860
Taking your services and working with you
has been a very good experience for me.

00:11.960 --> 00:13.800
I've been associated with you for 5–6 years.

00:14.920 --> 00:17.040
I feel like I've been working with you
for quite a long time,

00:17.840 --> 00:19.860
and your services are very good.

00:20.140 --> 00:22.200
Thank you so much, best wishes to you.
